NOT YET INCLUDED

The Singapore domains, the Thai visa domain and one EU anti-money-laundering domain
(eu/aml/amlr_cdd_obligations) quote material whose licence for republication has not
been established. So do a California privacy domain (it quotes the text published by the
California Privacy Protection Agency), a GDPR child-consent domain (national laws and
regulator pages of several Member States) and a GDPR impact-assessment domain (lists published
by the Irish, French and German data protection authorities). They are left out of this repository until permission is granted or
the quotations are re-sourced.
